  "aliases": {
    "_why": "Older spellings of registry relation ids, mapped to the id. Snapshots frozen before a rename (bear-linearity keeps the BEAR pack file names verbatim, with capitals and the four-underscore run a slash became) and older label keys resolve through this ONE table: canonical(id) in plots/shared/relation-sets.mjs and relation_sets.py. An alias that is itself a relation id, or points at no relation, fails on load. Keys starting with _ are notes.",
